# Rust build output
/target
**/target

# Downloaded installers and one-off tooling binaries — not build inputs
/.tools

# Probe and export scratch (never commit generated artifacts as inputs)
/probe-out
/export-out
*.tmp

# Editor and OS noise
.vs
.idea
Thumbs.ini
.DS_Store

# Intentionally NOT ignored:
#   Cargo.lock  — locked builds are a spec requirement
#   golden baselines and test fixtures — they are inputs, not output
